{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53800","headline":"辱牛仆射相公一札兼寄三篇寄怀雅意多兴味亦以三长句各各继来意次而和之 · 白居易","name":"辱牛仆射相公一札兼寄三篇寄怀雅意多兴味亦以三长句各各继来意次而和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忧悲欲作煎心火，荣利先爲翳眼尘。\n（同上《人事部·感兴》）（按：严绍荡以上列二首同列後题下，视爲同作三首中之二首，可参考。\n今仍分列。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}